  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Distributed Value near $16.15B (+1.8% 30D) keeps on-chain RWA exposure in a holding pattern\u2014tokenization momentum is still news- and pipeline-driven until distributed value breaks range. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-08-19-injective-becomes-sec-registered-transfer-agent-expands-tokenization-push-412225\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Injective becomes SEC-registered transfer agent as it expands tokenization push</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-08-20-ondo-executive-says-tokenization-following-same-path-as-early-etfs-412346\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ondo executive says tokenization is following the same path as early ETFs</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Tokenized T-bill supply is still expanding through new products:</strong> That usually shows up first as new issuer and product supply, then as higher distributed value and denser collateral-style use across networks and platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-08-20-gsr-baehr-tokenized-institutional-collateral-412302\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GSR\u2019s Baehr says tokenized fixed income could play key role in institutional collateral</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-proposal-forward-inapt-crypto-rules-commissioner-peirce?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SEC regulatory proposal marks \u2018important\u2019 step forward from \u2018inapt\u2019 crypto rules: Commissioner Peirce</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
